        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Slice A \u2014 two scopes, one review cycle (playback, 2026-07-18; refines ADR-0002/0007/0008/0009/0014; role-agnostic rewrite of 0005\u20130014 to follow)",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "bold"
          }
         ]
