         "type": "text",
         "text": "Internal formal cycle (mode 3)",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "bold"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "the same review-cycle workflow at sandbox scope: rounds on the frozen PDF, anchored comments, org-private DRR \u2014 retained permanently, never crosses the wall (the QA evidence). Lead closes; respond releases the lock; an accepting code = the QA-approved version"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
