        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "respond: issued comments to the authoring side \u2192 address in the sandbox, mandatory response links \u2192 promote vN+1 (the lock flips back)"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    "labelPosition": 0.5,
    "scale": 1,
    "elbowMidPoint": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "typeName": "shape",
   "id": "shape:note-link",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 950,
   "rotation": 0,
   "index": "aL",
   "parentId": "page:page",
   "isLocked": false,
   "opacity": 1,
   "meta": {},
   "props": {
    "color": "black",
    "size": "m",
    "font": "draw",
    "textAlign": "start",
    "w": 3260,
    "richText": {
     "type": "doc",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The missing link, made real: sandbox_document.container_id (nullable) \u2014 a draft carries its intended document reference from early drafting; the work item's production click-through follows it. Ad-hoc docs carry null until planned."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    "scale": 1,
    "autoSize": false
   }
  },
  {
   "typeName": "shape",
   "id": "shape:note-numbering",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1030,
   "rotation": 0,
   "index": "aM",
   "parentId": "page:page",
   "isLocked": false,
   "opacity": 1,
   "meta": {},
   "props": {
    "color": "black",
    "size": "m",
    "font": "draw",
    "textAlign": "start",
    "w": 3260,
    "richText": {
     "type": "doc",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Two reference series per deliverable: the sandbox freeze series (P-revs \u2014 internal churn, org-private) and the plan container's issued series (C-revs) \u2014 the reviewing side's history opens cleanly at v1. No gaps, no leak."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    "scale": 1,
    "autoSize": false
   }
  },
  {
   "typeName": "shape",
   "id": "shape:note-parked",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1110,
   "rotation": 0,
   "index": "aN",
   "parentId": "page:page",
   "isLocked": false,
   "opacity": 1,
   "meta": {},
   "props": {
    "color": "black",
    "size": "m",
    "font": "draw",
    "textAlign": "start",
    "w": 3260,
    "richText": {
     "type": "doc",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Parked (owner, 2026-07-18): whether the sandbox cycle reviews on a PDF rendition (ADR-0004) or on the frozen native text directly \u2014 establish the workflow first, finalise the method, then decide if the sandbox instance is identical. The comment anchor stays rendition-agnostic either way."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    "scale": 1,
    "autoSize": false
   }
  },
  {
   "typeName": "shape",
   "id": "shape:invariants",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1190,
   "rotation": 0,
   "index": "aO",
   "parentId": "page:page",
   "isLocked": false,
   "opacity": 1,
   "meta": {},
   "props": {
    "color": "black",
    "size": "m",
    "font": "draw",
    "textAlign": "start",
    "w": 3260,
    "richText": {
     "type": "doc",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Invariants this drawing commits us to",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "bold"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 one Version substrate \u2014 everything review-grade (rounds, DRR, anchored comments, renditions) binds to immutable Versions only; freeze = promote at sandbox scope"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 scope carries the rules \u2014 sandbox scope: never grounds, never crosses the wall, DRR org-private and retained permanently; project scope: ADR-0014 visibility + lock unchanged"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 ambient sandbox history is a tool, not a record \u2014 auto-snapshots, browsable, restorable; nothing binds to it"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 the check-out lock is ADR-0014's edit lock generalised to the sandbox head \u2014 per-cycle policy: internal formal = locked head, project cycle = live head"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 the cycle is role-agnostic \u2014 authoring side / reviewing side per cycle instance, not consultant/client; internal QA and client review are the same workflow at different scopes"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 the internal cycle is optional \u2014 a team may promote straight from the live head (ADR-0002's original path); freeze/QA is ceremony a team chooses, never a system gate"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "\u00b7 unchanged: one round open at a time; rounds close by human action, never the clock; anchors never drift; access resolved by the access model (ADR-0005/0006/0014)"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    "scale": 1,
    "autoSize": false
   }
  },
